---
description: Code style conventions
globs: src/**/*.{ts,tsx}
alwaysApply: false
---

- Function components, named exports, one component per file, files under ~150 lines.
- File names: PascalCase for components, camelCase for hooks/utils. Hooks start with `use`.
- TypeScript strict. No `any`; derive form types from Zod schemas.
- Comments only explain why something non-obvious is done. Never restate what code does. No JSDoc on obvious props. No banner or section-divider comments.
- No leftover console.log, commented-out code, or TODOs without context.
- Features import from `@/components/ui`, `@/lib`, `@/types`, `@/store` — never from another feature's internals.
- Domain values (KPIs, progress, ratios) are derived from store data, never hard-coded.
- Route tabs, filters and search live in the URL.
- Data views handle loading (skeleton), empty (EmptyState) and error states.
- Accessible by default: labels on inputs, aria-label on icon buttons, keyboard support for menus and drag-and-drop.
